WEBVTT

NOTE English accessibility captions. Dialogue checked against approved audio sources.
An em dash denotes speech cut off by the existing video edit.

00:00.400 --> 00:01.800
Dizzy Dot: Here I am!
[Cartoon bonk]

00:01.840 --> 00:03.000
Sir Sneaksalot: Keep it quiet!

00:03.000 --> 00:05.000
[Jaunty carnival music]

00:05.270 --> 00:06.600
Mimi: Just startled!
[Hollow bonk]

00:06.620 --> 00:07.700
Sir Sneaksalot: Hm!

00:07.720 --> 00:08.950
[Rubbery boing]

00:08.960 --> 00:10.350
Pip: Gah!

00:10.360 --> 00:12.700
Sir Sneaksalot: The getaway tunnel
is under renova—

00:12.700 --> 00:14.260
Sir Sneaksalot: Oh, bother!
[Spring rattles]

00:14.260 --> 00:15.050
Dizzy Dot: Whoops!

00:15.050 --> 00:15.840
Pip: Oops!

00:15.840 --> 00:17.500
Mimi: Please don't wrinkle my—

00:17.510 --> 00:18.500
[Soft plop]

00:18.500 --> 00:19.520
Grumble: Grr!

00:19.520 --> 00:20.680
Grumble: Point taken!

00:20.680 --> 00:21.890
Grumble: Give over!

00:21.890 --> 00:24.760
Pip: My secret weapon
is extremely secret.

00:24.770 --> 00:26.410
Mimi: Whoa!
[Spring rattles]

00:26.420 --> 00:27.550
Dizzy Dot: Which head?

00:27.550 --> 00:29.300
Dizzy Dot: Whoops!
Sir Sneaksalot: Most inconvenient!

00:29.930 --> 00:31.480
Sir Sneaksalot: Gah!

00:31.490 --> 00:32.830
Professor Pomp: Outrageous!
[Spring rattles]

00:32.840 --> 00:35.600
Pip: Save your applause
for my escape.

00:35.690 --> 00:36.700
Mimi: Eek!

00:38.000 --> 00:41.000
[Carnival music returns, then fades out]
